  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/662675/description_8815679d-4c27-448a-8268-39fbfef443b9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"730\" height=\"250\"></p><h4><strong>📖 關於：</strong></h4><p>末地風味是基於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫樂事</a>的附加模組，專注於為末地增添烹飪內容！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>📦 測試版</strong></h4><p>本模組目前<strong>仍在開發中</strong>，可能出現問題或不穩定情況。若您想遊玩，請注意：</p><ul>\n<li><strong>經常備份您的存檔</strong>；</li>\n<li>在加入整合包前請確認一切正常運作；</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>🔨</strong><strong>必要前置模組</strong>&nbsp;</h4><p><strong>Forge 版：</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>-農夫樂事</strong></a></p><p><strong>Fabric 版：</strong></p><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">-農夫樂事 [Fabric 版]</a></strong></p><p><strong>Refabricated 版：</strong></p><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-refabricated\" rel=\"nofollow\">-農夫樂事 Refabricated 版</a></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>✨我的新模組</strong></p><p><strong>🌿<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tea-aroma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">茶香縈繞</a></strong></p>",
